<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Team,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Fireflies just shipped dictation. Hold a key, talk, and clean text lands in any app—Gmail, Slack, docs, your CRM. No more typing. It&#x27;s included in our plan. Free. Unlimited.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">What it does</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Say something, it cleans it up. Ums, false starts, backtracking—none of that makes it in. Punctuation comes automatically. Format adapts to where you paste it—an email reads like an email, a Slack message reads like a Slack message.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Name someone in Slack while dictating? They get tagged. Saves keystrokes.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">The money</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Competitors charge $12–$15 a month for this. We have it. Included. 90+ languages. On device only—Fireflies stores nothing, no one in your workspace sees your dictations.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Install</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Fireflies desktop app, Mac and Windows. Two minutes to set up. Fn on Mac, Ctrl+Win on Windows. Talk. Done. Mobile coming soon.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding-top:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#4F575E">Shad</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23"></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
